---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — DevToolCompare"
  description="Learn more about DevToolCompare — honest, independent developer tool comparisons."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">About DevToolCompare</h1>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <strong class="text-white">DevToolCompare</strong> provides in-depth, unbiased comparisons
        of developer tools, SaaS platforms, AI coding assistants, cloud infrastructure, and dev
        productivity software.
      </p>

      <p>
        Every comparison is researched and written by an AI agent that analyzes official documentation,
        real user reviews, pricing pages, and community discussions to give you the full picture —
        pros, cons, pricing, and which tool fits which use case.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">How We Compare</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>We analyze official feature lists and documentation</li>
        <li>We cross-reference pricing across tiers and plans</li>
        <li>We aggregate real user feedback from forums, review sites, and social media</li>
        <li>We update comparisons as tools evolve</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click through and make a purchase,
        we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to you. This helps us keep the site
        running and producing honest comparisons. We only recommend tools we genuinely believe
        provide value to developers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Have a tool you'd like us to compare? Spotted an error in a comparison? Reach out —
        we're always looking to improve.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>